      "@id": "skills/authoring/authoring-core/evidence-review.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The rule is not a platform invention",
      "prov:value": "That is `untainted-verification`'s sentence with the nouns changed, and it long\npredates this repository. Guideline methodology separates the **systematic\nreview team** from the **guideline development group** for exactly the reason\nthe spine gives: a party assessing its own output is comparing a thing with its\nown paraphrase of itself."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/authoring/authoring-core/evidence-review.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The fencing analysis — which rules are the platform's, and which are not",
      "prov:value": "Declaring empty criteria for them\nwould be bean `dh4f` exactly: a consumer scanning nothing and reporting a clean\nrun over it.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean dh4f"
      ]
    }
  ]
